---
// src/components/Hero.astro
---

<section class="relative overflow-hidden pt-12 pb-20 md:pt-20 md:pb-28">
  <!-- Background Glow & Grid -->
  <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-radial-glow pointer-events-none"></div>
  <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-[linear-gradient(to_right,#1e293b15_1px,transparent_1px),linear-gradient(to_bottom,#1e293b15_1px,transparent_1px)] bg-[size:4rem_4rem] [mask-image:radial-gradient(ellipse_60%_50%_at_50%_0%,#000_70%,transparent_100%)] pointer-events-none"></div>

  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 relative z-10 text-center">
    <!-- Highlight Badge -->
    <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-4 py-2 rounded-full border border-brand-500/30 bg-brand-950/40 text-brand-300 text-xs sm:text-sm font-medium mb-8 backdrop-blur-sm animate-fade-in shadow-glow">
      <span class="flex h-2 w-2 rounded-full bg-brand-400"></span>
      Desarrollo Web a Medida & Modernización de Sitios
    </div>

    <!-- Main Headline -->
    <h1 class="title-fluid font-black text-white max-w-5xl mx-auto tracking-tight mb-6">
      Transformo la web de tu negocio en un <span class="bg-gradient-to-r from-brand-400 via-indigo-300 to-accent-400 bg-clip-text text-transparent">imán de clientes</span> y credibilidad.
    </h1>

    <!-- Subheadline -->
    <p class="subtitle-fluid text-slate-300 max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-10 leading-relaxed font-normal">
      ¿Tu sitio actual carga lento o no se ve profesional en celulares? Ayudo a personas, consultores y empresas a renovar su presencia online o construir páginas web de alta velocidad que convierten visitas en cotizaciones reales.
    </p>

    <!-- CTAs -->
    <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-center gap-4 max-w-md mx-auto mb-16">
      <a
        href="#cotizador"
        class="w-full sm:w-auto inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 px-8 py-4 rounded-xl font-bold text-base text-white bg-gradient-to-r from-brand-600 via-indigo-600 to-accent-600 hover:from-brand-500 hover:to-accent-500 shadow-glow transition-all duration-300 hover:scale-[1.02] active:scale-[0.98]"
      >
        <span>Cotizar mi renovación / web</span>
        <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
          <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M14 5l7 7m0 0l-7 7m7-7H3" />
        </svg>
      </a>
      <a
        href="#portafolio"
        class="w-full sm:w-auto inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 px-8 py-4 rounded-xl font-semibold text-base text-slate-200 bg-slate-900/80 hover:bg-slate-800 border border-slate-700/80 hover:border-slate-600 transition-all duration-300 hover:scale-[1.02]"
      >
        Ver proyectos & resultados
      </a>
    </div>

    <!-- Trust Badges & Metrics Grid -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-4 gap-4 max-w-4xl mx-auto pt-8 border-t border-slate-800/80 text-left">
      <div class="p-4 rounded-2xl bg-slate-900/40 border border-slate-800/60 backdrop-blur-sm">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-emerald-400 font-bold text-lg mb-1">
          <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M13 10V3L4 14h7v7l9-11h-7z" />
          </svg>
          &lt; 0.8s
        </div>
        <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 font-medium">Velocidad de carga optimizada (100 Google Lighthouse)</p>
      </div>

      <div class="p-4 rounded-2xl bg-slate-900/40 border border-slate-800/60 backdrop-blur-sm">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-brand-400 font-bold text-lg mb-1">
          <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 18h.01M8 21h8a2 2 0 002-2V5a2 2 0 00-2-2H8a2 2 0 00-2 2v14a2 2 0 002 2z" />
          </svg>
          100% Mobile
        </div>
        <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 font-medium">Experiencia táctil impecable en cualquier dispositivo</p>
      </div>

      <div class="p-4 rounded-2xl bg-slate-900/40 border border-slate-800/60 backdrop-blur-sm">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-accent-400 font-bold text-lg mb-1">
          <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M3 10h18M7 15h1m4 0h1m-7 4h12a3 3 0 003-3V8a3 3 0 00-3-3H6a3 3 0 00-3 3v8a3 3 0 003 3z" />
          </svg>
          Stripe Ready
        </div>
        <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 font-medium">Integración de cobros y señas seguras con 0% recargos</p>
      </div>

      <div class="p-4 rounded-2xl bg-slate-900/40 border border-slate-800/60 backdrop-blur-sm">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-indigo-400 font-bold text-lg mb-1">
          <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m5.618-4.016A11.955 11.955 0 0112 2.944a11.955 11.955 0 01-8.618 3.04A12.02 12.02 0 003 9c0 5.591 3.824 10.29 9 11.622 5.176-1.332 9-6.03 9-11.622 0-1.042-.133-2.052-.382-3.016z" />
          </svg>
          SSL & Hosting
        </div>
        <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 font-medium">Dominio seguro, CDN mundial y protección continua</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
